The function supports dynamic configuration updates, allowing for the addition or removal of structures without interrupting ongoing processing. A notification system is implemented to alert other components when the list is modified, ensuring all dependent systems are kept in sync. The function gracefully handles exceptions and optimizes performance for batch processing while minimizing memory fragmentation.

